OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe day will begin breezy and
OL,6,Fmostly dry with only a chance of the
OL,7,Fodd morning shower in the west. The
OL,8,Fsunny spells will increase as the wind
OL,9,Feases down in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear spells. High cloud will spread
OL,13,Feast from the late evening with rain
OL,14,Fand drizzle following from shortly
OL,15,Fafter midnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA cloudy start with rain and
OL,18,Fdrizzle soon clearing east. The rest
OL,19,Fof the day will stay dry with
OL,20,Fincreasing sunny periods.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
