OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBands
OL,6,Fof cloud and rain, some heavy, pass
OL,7,Fsoutheast Tuesday and Wednesday. Drier
OL,8,FWednesday night and early Thursday.
OL,9,FFurther rain will then push southeast
OL,10,FThursday.
